sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-raup-shell-coiling> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-13-morphology-audit-raup-shell-coiling-specimen-match> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-13-morphology-audit-raup-shell-coiling-specimen-match-0> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
